{"attack":"抛下狠话威吓对手，降低攻击和特攻后，和后备宝可梦进行替换。","description":"令目标的攻击降低1级。\n令目标的特攻降低1级。\n抛下狠话使用成功时，使用者与后备宝可梦替换，除非使用者是同行宝可梦中唯一没有陷入濒死状态的宝可梦。\n若当回合使用者被追打定为目标，且使用者先行动，则退场前会受到翻倍威力的追打攻击。\n即使自身受到扎根、束缚、无法逃走或踩影、沙穴、磁力的影响，也可以替换宝可梦。\n受到魔法镜特性或者魔法反射状态影响时，招式被反弹，会让原本的目标方进行替换宝可梦。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Pancham","Level":40},{"Name":"Pangoro","Level":46},{"Name":"Silvally","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:grass","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:fire","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:water","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:flying","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:bug","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:poison","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:electric","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:psychic","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:rock","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:ground","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:dark","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:ghost","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:steel","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:fighting","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:ice","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:dragon","Level":60},{"Name":"Silvally form:fairy","Level":60},{"Name":"Thievul","Level":52},{"Name":"Bombirdier","Level":60},{"Name":"Munkidori","Level":72}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Meowth form:alolan","Persian form:alolan","Zigzagoon form:galarian","Linoone form:galarian","Litten","Torracat","Incineroar","Impidimp","Morgrem","Obstagoon","Morpeko form:fullbelly","Morpeko form:hangry","Squawkabilly form:green","Squawkabilly form:blue","Squawkabilly form:yellow","Squawkabilly form:white","Shroodle","Grafaiai","Varoom","Revavroom"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Incineroar","Impidimp","Morgrem"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}